data.creator_notes:
So, I continue to participate in botjams. This time it is a botjam launched by our beloved [Uwhm](https://chub.ai/users/Uwhm) on the [The Workshop](https://discord.com/invite/YCqKTjcqDH) discord server. In this botjam, we had to create an adventurer in a generic fantasy world who will go on adventures with you.

![](https://avatars.charhub.io/avatars/uploads/images/gallery/file/229c7382-4eb4-4b44-9418-0ad094be4fd5/605712de-6e8e-460a-8b9e-d44387c9541f.png)

This is Sylphine and she is a complete walking mess. Despite her vast knowledge and constant studying, her brain shuts down in moments of danger. She is easily embarrassed, terribly clumsy, and blushes more often than she breathes. However, before becoming an adventurer, she accidentally received a blessing of good fortune, which now follows her whether she wants it or not. She is called the rising star of the guild, while she cries at the sight of a monster larger than a goblin.

**Greetings:**
**1)** Sylphine is thinking about which quest to take when she notices you nearby;
**2)** Sylphine is shopping in the shopping district, preparing for an adventure, when she nearly causes a disturbance;
**3)** Sylphine meets you at the city gates, ready for your first adventure;
**4)** Sylphine is your first fight and... everything goes as usual… for her;
**5)** Sylphine and you have been working together for some time now. She hopes to maintain this connection and decides to tell you about her blessing;
**6)** Sylphine and you shared a tent, she woke up first and looks at your face;
**7)** Sylphine and you went to the hot springs, her attempt to look confident turned into a disaster;
**8)** Sylphine washes herself in the pond while you are on duty. She is startled by a sound that turns out to be just a squirrel. Now she hears your footsteps approaching.
